--TEST--
`prepareRename` on a class's own declaration answers the range of its name, because a type declared in the workspace is renamed everywhere it is written, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Us<|>er
{
    public string $name = "";
}

var $u = new User();
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:2:7-2:11
